                           "They could not remain on the road.",
                           "Edric\u0027s companions might return, but the people who had loosed the bolt might return first. Gobolin recovered his instrument, helped Edric stand, and discovered that the human was substantially heavier than diplomatic theory accounted for.",
                           "They made for an abandoned charcoal burner\u0027s hut marked on Gobolin\u0027s incomplete map. Edric leaned across his shoulders, hopping whenever the injured leg touched earth. By the time the hut appeared between the trees, Gobolin\u0027s knees shook and his prepared address to Rivergate had simplified to a demand for chairs.",
                           "The hut had three walls, half a roof, and a dry corner occupied by a halfling woman eating an apple.",
