                           "“Afternoon,” she said.",
                           "Edric tried to straighten. “Rivergate patrol.”",
                           "“You should patrol somewhere drier.”",
                           "“We need shelter.”",
                           "“So do I. Fortunately, the hut appears capable of accommodating several social classes.” Her eyes moved to Gobolin, his blade, and the blood on both travelers. “Are we rescuing him or kidnapping him?”",
