                           "“I am Gobolin.”",
                           "“Moss.”",
                           "That exhausted Moss\u0027s interest in introduction.",
                           "Gobolin bought stew and listened. A wool merchant blamed mountain goblins for three lost wagons. A drover swore the attackers had human boots. A cooper\u0027s widow said the watch ignored her husband\u0027s disappearance because Lady Merrow\u0027s cargo had burned the same night. At the wealthy tables, every loss was an attack on trade. At the poor ones, every loss had a name.",
                           "Moss played through all of it.",
