                           "“Why tell me?”",
                           "“You listened before asking me to speak.”",
                           "Pip appeared with three mugs. “Also, Lady Merrow\u0027s consortium bought every warehouse near the east quay this winter. If the hill road closes, river freight triples.”",
                           "“How do you know?”",
                           "“I deliver bills to people who cannot imagine couriers read.”",
                           "The inn door opened. A gnome in a blue academic coat stepped inside, shook rain from a silver-tipped cane, and frowned at the company.",
                           "Mara hurried to him. “Master Gongo. Your usual?”",
                           "Gobolin nearly dropped his mug.",
                           "Master Gongo of the Golden Harp looked exactly like the portrait in Gobolin\u0027s red book, except older, smaller, and substantially less pleased by the world.",
                           "Gobolin stood. “Master, my name is—”",
                           "“I know who you are. Half the town has discovered the news, embroidered it, and sold copies.” Gongo\u0027s gaze settled on the mandolin case. “You wish to study.”",
                           "“How could you know that?”",
                           "“No one carries an instrument that carefully unless it contains either music or explosives. Your posture suggests the former.”",
