                           "Suspicion would not hold Lady Merrow. They needed records, witnesses, or goods that could be traced to her. Gobolin also carried the raider\u0027s last words and had told no one. He called the omission caution: Ruk\u0027s name would turn the council toward war before it explained anything. In truth, Ruk was clan, however estranged, and Gobolin wanted one fact that had not already become Rivergate property.",
