                           "The council forbade Gobolin to leave while Merrow\u0027s allies demanded a trial. Even members who believed him had cause: he had concealed a material witness statement, misrepresented his authority, and helped provoke Merrow into action inside the town. Duchess Elira privately warned that legal delay would last until the valley fell.",
